  "RNL standard packages · Rich Netlist": "RNL 标准包 · Rich Netlist",
  "The standard packages of Rich Netlist (RNL): what each package is for and the text that defines it, every symbol as it is drawn with its pins and box, and the rules that give elements their symbols.": "Rich Netlist（RNL）的标准包：每个包的用途与定义原文、每个符号绘制出的外观、引脚与边界框，以及为元件指定符号的规则。",
