  "What the standard packages hold: every symbol as it is drawn, and the text that defines it": "标准包的内容：每个符号绘制出的外观，以及定义它的原文",
  "A file of 0.4 uses no package unless its header record names it. <code>rnl-std-all</code> is the one collection of the series: it brings in the sub-packages that give elements their symbols and objects their styles, define the circuit structures, and fill in grounds, supplies and net labels for unwired pins. A file may name the sub-packages one by one instead, and add packages that are used on demand, such as <code>rnl-std-45deg</code> for 45-degree symbols. (In the series 0.3 and 0.2, <code>rnl-std</code> is at the root of every netlist by default.) This page lists every package with what it is for, what it references and the text that defines it; the symbols are drawn by the RNL core when the site is built, as the viewers draw them.": "0.4 版的文件除非在头段记录中写明，否则不会使用任何包。<code>rnl-std-all</code> 是该系列唯一的包集合：它引入多个子包，分别为元件指定符号、为对象设置样式、定义电路结构，并为未接线的引脚补上接地、电源与网络标签。文件也可以改用逐个写明子包的方式，并按需加入其他包（例如用于 45 度符号的 <code>rnl-std-45deg</code>）。（在 0.3 与 0.2 系列中，每份网表的根层级默认都会使用 <code>rnl-std</code>。）本页列出每个包的用途、引用关系与定义原文；所有符号均在网站构建时由 RNL 核心绘制，与查看器中呈现的结果完全一致。",
